# A2x Test Range - conformance tests for the arme2cosmos converter's ASSUMED behaviors: that
# the a2x / LegendaryMissions calls the tool emits actually produce the intended runtime effect
# (the tool's own unit tests only check that the right call is emitted). A standalone mission
# that loads the built LM mastlibs, so these tests never ship inside LM or sbs_utils. Run one:
#     python -m cosmos_dev.mission_runner A2xTestRange --map test_convert_ai --test 30
